00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:47.370
<i>Desumi-san... dressed as a maid?!</i>

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.710
I would give my life to attend!

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:52.900
Hooray!

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:57.080
But make sure you come on Sunday, 
the festival's last day.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:03.150
There's a legend at Kokutei High School.

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.580
For the finale of the final 
day of the Kokutei Festival,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.590
the staff makes a crescent-shaped 
sculpture available for one hour only.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.000
It's called the "Kokutei Moon."

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:18.330
The Kokutei Moon is a popular spot for 
couples to take pictures together.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.460
And it's said that those who do

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.930
