bound in love for eternity.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.100
Well? Isn't that interesting?!

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.060
What a clever idea!

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:32.680
I already consider us an invincible couple,

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:35.690
