a little supernatural backing!

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.540
But a school festival will 
surely be extremely crowded...

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.950
Yes, we must be certain we aren't seen.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.080
This will no doubt be our 
toughest mission yet!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.730
Bring it on, I say!

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.310
Let's do it, Desumi-san!

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.960
Yes, Fudo!

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.840
