00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.810
Are you crazy or something?!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:08.400
And why the hell isn't the sight of a 
bear in school causing a mass panic?

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.370
Look at that bear costume!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.020
Awesome quality!

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:15.050
Nice! Must be pretty hot in that thing!

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.810
