00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.470
Oh, that's right...

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.300
Look, Fudo.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:31.290
These are the sweets we serve 
in our class's maid café.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:42.600
