00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:50.560
I might be the luckiest master 
in all of human history!

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.420
Oh, you!

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:55.790
They're delicious.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.480
I'm glad to hear it.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:04.330
But... it really might be impossible 
for us to be alone together

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.590
at the school festival, Fudo.

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:10.630
No, I believe we can overcome any 
trial the world throws at us!

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.440
We must arrive at it no matter what...

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.780
Our shared Kokutei Moon!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:26.930
Fudo...

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.890
Yes, you're right.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.300
I should have confidence in us.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.700
I feel bad for leaving my class in the lurch,

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.780
