Fudo!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.370
Now's our chance!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.830
R-Right!

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.220
We're running out of time!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.500
I know that.

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.720
But they all recognize you...

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.260
And Princess Series members 
are all around us.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:05.360
<b>Kokutei Festival</b>

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:05.360
Just five minutes left with the Kokutei Moon!

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:18.710
To break through the crowd and sit 
there without anyone seeing us...

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.550
I'm out of ideas!

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.680
Who in the world are you?

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.110
I thought you were Bear-sama!

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:32.920
Hang on! You're the one who grabbed on to me!

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.710
What are you trying to pull with 
this extremely detailed costume?!

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.980
I just really like bears, okay?!

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:40.570
Then where is the real Bear-sama?!

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.200
How should I know?!

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.250
Oh, for pity's sake!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.140
Cosplay makes everything so confusing!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.020
Fudo! We still have a chance!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.860
We can't give up yet!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.190
Desumi-san?

00:16:56.670 --> 00:17:02.450
We'll take one more couple 
before closing up shop!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:02.450
<b>Kokutei Festival</b>

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.960
A-Are you sure we can do it?

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.000
Yes, I know that we can.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.710
There's nothing we can't do!

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:10.090
Right?

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.270
Indeed.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.940
You're right,

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.080
Desumi-san!

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.680
Freezing Change!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.150
Welcome Evil! Punish Good!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:34.670
<i>One! Change Gelato!</i>

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:38.160
Reaper Change!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.520
Let's go, Desumi-san!

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.500
Yes, Fudo!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:07.890
Just one couple left?

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.230
Hey, look at that!

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.660
That's so cool!

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.330
Awesome taste!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:18.400
Amazing quality, too!

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:20.720
It's pretty fanfic, though.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:21.660
Totally.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.320
Red Gelato and Reaper Princess, getting along?

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.130
When you and I work together,

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.700
there is nothing that we cannot achieve.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:03.700
Yes, because we are an invincible couple.

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:08.160
Perhaps the day when we can see 
each other with heads held high

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.600
isn't so far away after all, Fudo.

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.710
Yes indeed, Desumi-san.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:20.140
And until that day comes, I'm going 
to enjoy having this little secret!

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.250
Yes.

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.190
Okay! I'm taking the picture!

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.670
Hey, did you hear?

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:25.430
Culverin Bear and Steel-chan are dating!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.170
Oh hang on, is that for real?

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:30.390
I totally had a feeling, though!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:35.120
I hear they were together at the 
high school culture festival.

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.180
Young love goals!

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:40.400
A culture festival date 
is total young love goals!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.730
Right?

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.830
But inter-company romance 
is against the rules.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:46.910
So actually going through with it 
seems a little inappropriate.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:50.050
But that's what makes it frickin' sweet!

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:51.160
Hey, hey...

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:55.010
If you were gonna date someone, 
who'd you go for? Matchlock Eagle?

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:56.290
Oh, no!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.790
He's far too self-aggrandizing.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:01.910
Then what about Railgun Lion?

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:02.980
I don't think so...

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:05.510
I can't handle those "ora-ora" types.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.630
Hard same!

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.550
Gatling Wolf?

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:11.160
He's too neurotic and fastidious.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:12.760
I don't think I could ever date him.

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.190
A good man is hard to find, isn't he?

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:20.910
Yeah, and it's so crazy!

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:24.580
I can't believe Steel's into Culverin Bear!

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:27.170
She is still young, though.

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:30.170
Maybe she's confused huggability 
for something else.

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:33.690
Doubt you'll see any other member of the 
Princess Series doing the romance thing!

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:35.290
What about Reaper-chan?

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:45.100
Reaper, huh? Yeah, nah!

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:46.010
You think?

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:46.590
Oh, totes nah!

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.090
Yeah, you're right.

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:51.760
I'm back!

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:53.510
Have you been a good girl?

00:22:54.670 --> 00:22:57.910
<i>My mistress had another good day, I suppose.</i>

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:00.760
Ready for my hot bath!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.310
<i>Because of that goon of a man, I suppose.</i>

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>Not that I like to admit it.</i>

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:16.940
<i>But if my mistress is happy, 
I suppose I'll allow it.</i>

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:23.210
<i>What is justice? What is peace?</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:27.460
<i>Like hot-burning ice, they break 
through the chaos of the age!</i>

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:30.700
<i>Their name, Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!</i>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.740
<i>Tune in next week!</i>

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:35.680
<i>Next time, Episode 11: "What's the
 Point of Getting Closer?"</i>

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 11   What's the Point of Getting Closer?

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.430
Humanity, preach love!

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.890
<i>Is that what this show is about?</i>

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.890
<b><i>Clink...</i></b>
